e] were My punishment and warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"54:17","t":"And We have certainly made the Qur’ān easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"54:18","t":"ʿAad denied; and how [severe] were My punishment and warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"54:19","t":"Indeed, We sent upon them a screaming wind on a day of continuous misfortune,","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"54:20","t":"Extracting the people as if they were trunks of palm trees uprooted.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"54:21","t":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"54:22","t":"And We have certainly made the Qur’ān easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"54:23","t":"Thamūd denied the warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"54:24","t":"And said, \"Is it one human being among us that we should follow? Indeed, we would then be in error and madness.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"54:25","t":"Has the message been sent down upon him from among us? Rather, he is an insolent liar.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"54:26","t":"They will know tomorrow who is the insolent liar.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"54:27","t":"Indeed, We are sending the she-camel as trial for them, so watch them and be patient.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":27,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":53,"surahs":[54],"sajdah":false}